然后她说，但别担心，她有。

00:26:08.195 --> 00:26:11.837
And it's like this, it's at the beginning kind of of the article.
这就像是在文章开头。

00:26:11.837 --> 00:26:25.900
And it's this great narrative thing of like, I'm setting up suspense, that I'm going to pull the rug out from under, because I have other suspenseful things to tell you, we're going to a dispense with the suspense, I'm going to tell you what happened.
这是一种很棒的叙事手法，我制造了悬念，然后又将其打破，因为我有其他悬念要告诉你，我们要抛弃这个悬念，我要告诉你发生了什么。

00:26:25.900 --> 00:26:29.460
So it creates a new kind of suspense.
所以它创造了一种新的悬念。

00:26:29.460 --> 00:26:30.460
What is in this journal?
日记里写了什么？

00:26:30.460 --> 00:26:31.460
